 customers flood Amazon with  online orders the company reported its  quarterly revenue rose 26 percent from a  year earlier but profit fell Amazon  faces additional costs including higher  shipping costs pay rises and kovat 19  tests for workers Apple says its revenue  rose 1% even as the pandemic shut down  factories and dented sales in China with  strong sales of services and wearables
 

